#: klatinverbs.cpp:202
msgid ""
"_: Note: ARGUMENT %1 is an ordinal number (1st, 2nd, 3rd).ARGUMENT %2 is the "
"tense of the verb (Present, Imperfect, Perfect).ARGUMENT %3 is the mood of "
"the verb (Indicative, Subjunctive).ARGUMENT %4 is the voice of the verb "
"(Active, Passive).ARGUMENT %5 is the verb name (amo, moneo etc). This is in "
"Latin and should not be translated.The output string in English is something "
"like: What is the first person singular present indicative active of amo?\n"
"What is the %1 person %2 %3 %4 %5 of %6?"
msgstr ""

